      "body": "https://www.qzwrite.com/\n\n千章网文创作系统覆盖从创意规划、章节生成到质量审校的完整工作流。 用户负责创意和决策，AI 负责执行和校验。\n\n<img width=\"1275\" height=\"865\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ef2cb2e3-d83a-4781-8b8c-d051e6519c6b\" />\n\n<img width=\"1278\" height=\"861\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/bc9217a2-2f72-4388-a3af-c736bddcc76e\" />\n\n<img width=\"1413\" height=\"863\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/afd6d949-d2fb-4a0f-9114-bcea6c5bccde\" />\n\n",
